publishers (U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics, PayScale, Glassdoor, Indeed,
ZipRecruiter, RepVue, Bridge Group, trade publications, and others) and remain
the property of those publishers. U.S. Government works such as BLS data are in
the public domain. See sources.md for full attribution. This repository does not
republish any source's full dataset — only cited summary figures used for
benchmarking and commentary.

